# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test fixtures
#
# The PDFs under tests/fixtures/ ARE tracked. They are checked in so tests and
# CI never need a TeX installation and never skip missing integration coverage.
# Regenerate them from the tracked .tex sources/assets with
# `uv run python tests/fixtures/build_fixtures.py`; the builder also writes the
# small deterministic tagged/rotated PDFs. Do not ignore tests/fixtures/*.pdf.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# LaTeX auxiliary files produced during compilation. The build script cleans
# these up, but ignore them defensively anywhere they might appear.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk

# Duplicate of the tracked tests/fixtures/sample.png, copied into the tex dir
# for compilation. It is a redundant copy of a tracked asset, so ignore it.
tests/fixtures/tex/sample.png
